|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Azir}} summons a {{as|Sand Soldier|buzzword2}} to attack nearby targets for him, replacing his {{tip|basic attack|basic attacks}} against enemies within their range. Their attacks deal {{as|magic damage}} to enemies in a line.
|blurb2       = {{as|Sand Soldiers|buzzword2}} expire faster near {{tip|turrets}} and instantly when {{ci|Azir}} leaves them.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Azir''' summons a {{as|Sand Soldier|buzzword2}} at the target location that is {{tip|untargetable}}, lasts 10 seconds, and grants {{tip|sight}} of its surroundings. The {{as|Sand Soldier|buzzword2}} expires twice as fast while within range of an enemy {{tip|turret}}, and does so instantly if '''Azir''' is too far away.<br><br>'''Azir''' periodically [[stock]]s a {{as|Sand Soldier|buzzword2}}, up to a maximum of 2.
|description2 = When '''Azir''' declares a basic attack against an enemy in a soldier's {{sti|attack range}}, the {{as|Sand Soldier|buzzword2}} attacks in his stead, thrusting their spear in the target's direction to deal {{as|magic damage}} to enemies struck in a line. Against the primary target, the {{as|Sand Soldier's|buzzword2}} attack applies {{tip|on-hit}} and {{tip|on-attack}} effects, with on-hit damage reduced to 50% effectiveness. Targets hit beyond the closest take {{pp|20; then +8*x for 10|1;9 to 18|formula=20% at level 1, then +8% per level starting at level 9 and capped at level 18|key=%}}<!--stops at 18--> damage. Subsequent {{as|Sand Soldier|buzzword2}} attacks against the same target deal 25% damage without applying {{tip|on-hit}} and {{tip|on-attack}} effects.
|leveling2    = {{st|Magic Damage|{{pplevel|0; then +8*x|1;10+(x-1)|formula=0 at level 1, then +8 per level starting at level 10}} (+ {{ap|50 to 110}}) {{as|(+ {{ap|35 to 65}}% AP)}}}}
|description3 = {{as|Sand Soldiers|buzzword2}} cannot attack {{tip|turret|structures}}, {{tip|ward|wards}}, nor {{tip|stealthed trap|traps}}.
